WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.030
A patient is dying.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.960
Her family beg the doctor to
tell her there is still hope.

3
00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.940
The doctor is a Christian.

4
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:11.600
The Bible says: you shall
not give false testimony.

5
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.710
Jesus also says: love one another.

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:19.310
So when Christians decide what
is right, who has the final say?

7
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.230
The Bible?

8
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.230
The Church?

9
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.140
Reason?

10
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.420
Or love?

11
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:26.360
In this mission, you'll meet
three Christian answers,

12
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:29.070
from Martin Luther to Joseph Fletcher.

13
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:32.480
Then you'll test each answer
on the doctor's hard case,

14
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:36.180
and see which source each
one lets have the final say.

15
00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:40.750
Your mission: find out where Christians
look when they decide what is right.
